{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-02_end","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-02","title":"防衛","storyCode":"0-2","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"7fd861b3dcc15510e5826255c8c26d10a57915781d00af65b7da4d41e0dd2a9c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"ドクターと一行は、ウルサスの憲兵団に遭遇する。両者が一触即発となったその時、レユニオン幹部の率いる部隊がやってきた。\nしかし、レユニオンと対峙した憲兵たちは、ロドス一行をその場から逃がしてくれたのだった。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"っはあ、はぁっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンの奴ら、なんて勢いだ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――おい！　そこの貴様ら、何者だ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"こんな時に、ここで何をしている！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ？　な、何って――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"言いよどむとは、まさか連中のスパイか！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（ウルサス当局に正体を知られたら、面倒なことになる……！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（となれば――）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そちらの憲兵さん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……子供……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"っ、貴様……感染者か？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"そこから動くな！　武器を置け！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……！　（小声）防護の準備を。向こうが敵対姿勢を見せたら、すぐに――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"待て、これは霧か……？　一体どこから……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"お願いです、話を聞いてください！　我々の共通の敵は誰なのか、本当はあなたもよくわかっているはずですよね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ッ――！　ドーベルマンさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ！　――重装オペレーター！　敵襲だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"な、何ッ……！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……レユニオン……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ、気をつけろ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"ほかの連中とは何かが違う。奴は恐らく、相当の実力者だ！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_1_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"フン、逃げ出すか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"無駄なことを。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"行け。奴らを八つ裂きにしろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――了解。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"あの動き……部下の練度も相当高いな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"となると、率いる彼女はレユニオンの幹部クラスか……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……先ほどから、段々と霧が濃くなってきていますね。この機に乗じて、奇襲を仕掛けてくるかもしれません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"憲兵団のみなさんも、すぐにここから離れてください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"退路が断たれる前に離脱しなければ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――断る。行くなら、貴様らだけで行け。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……見逃してやるということだ。さっさと消えるがいい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我々は、この場を死守せよと命を受けている。持ち場を離れるわけにはいかんのだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……子ウサギよ。貴様のような感染者が、ここを訪れた目的に興味などないが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"この街を破壊するために来たのなら、いずれ必ず罰を受けることになる。ウルサスの潰えぬ怒りの炎によって、な。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"しかし、そうでないのなら……ここで起きていることは、貴様らとはなんの関係もないことだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――わかりました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ならば行け。これ以上構っている暇はないのでな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――ウルサス人たる者、敵に背を向けるわけにはいかんのだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ありがとう、ございます。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"行きましょう、ドーベルマンさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"了解。――総員、第一合流地点へと向かえ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"グズグズするな！　各小隊、速やかに行動せよ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来い、感染者ども！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"どうした、突っ立っているだけでは始まらんぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"チェルノボーグのクズ野郎が……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"――皆殺しにしてやる。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["前衛オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["ドーベルマン"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
